## Why This Is Asked
Tests understanding of cross-account temporary access, least-privilege IAM policies, and time-bound credentials using STS.

## Key Concepts
- Cross-account trust via AssumeRole
- Least privilege scoped to a specific S3 prefix
- Role duration controls expiry
- Testing access during and after the window

## Code Example
```json
// Trust policy (for the role in OUR account)
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Principal": {"AWS": "arn:aws:iam::PARTNER_ACCOUNT_ID:root"},
      "Action": "sts:AssumeRole"
    }
  ]
}
```
```json
// Role policy (least privilege for PIX123)
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": ["s3:ListBucket"],
      "Resource": "arn:aws:s3:::shared-docs",
      "Condition": {"StringLike": {"s3:prefix": ["contracts/PIX123/*"]}}
    },
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": ["s3:GetObject"],
      "Resource": "arn:aws:s3:::shared-docs/contracts/PIX123/*"
    }
  ]
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you revoke access before expiry if required?
- How would you audit the access and ensure logs show the temporary session usage?

## Why This Is Asked

Assess ability to design scalable, resilient streaming pipelines on AWS, balancing compute warm-start strategies, data correctness (exactly-once), deployment safety, and observability under real-world load spikes.

## Key Concepts

- Lambda provisioned concurrency
- Kinesis Enhanced Fan-Out
- Idempotent processing and deduplication
- Dead-letter queues (DLQ)
- Canary/Blue-Green deployment with CodeDeploy
- Observability (CloudWatch, X-Ray)
- Data durability in S3 with versioning

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-idempotent handler
function handle(record) {
  const id = record.eventSourceARN + ':' + record.sequenceNumber;
  if (cache.has(id)) return;
  // process
  storeRecord(record);
  cache.set(id, true);
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you implement exactly-once semantics across DynamoDB and S3 writes?
- What metrics signal a regression after deployment, and how would you respond?
